      "id": "claim_ba0e430361374ce6868f5cd080fb4a7f",
      "statement": "`ExecutorKind` enumerates every runtime the server can name — 'mock', 'opencode', 'codex', 'claude', 'hermes', 'gemini', 'editor', 'pi', 'docker', 'deep-agent', and 'custom' — and the ExecutionEngine constructor always registers the eight defaults mock/opencode/codex/claude/hermes/gemini/editor/pi while registering deep-agent only when DJIMIT_DEEP_ENABLED=true (also instantiating the DeepAgentContractIssuer).",
