      "id": "claim_a29e327bd6b34346b811ef26ab238528",
      "statement": "The TaskExecutor contract is `kind`, `start(task, options) → Promise<ExecutionSession>`, `canExecute(task) → boolean`, and optional `buildCommand(task, options) → { command, args }`; buildCommand is what lets DockerSandboxExecutor re-host an inner executor's CLI invocation without re-implementing argument construction.",
