      "id": "claim_252f558b4ec94e1dbde1388f8962b161",
      "statement": "DockerSandboxExecutor wraps an inner TaskExecutor, requires inner.buildCommand (else DOCKER_SANDBOX_INNER_COMMAND_UNAVAILABLE), reports kind:'docker', and enforces non-root user (1000:1000), --cap-drop ALL, no-new-privileges, read-only root + tmpfs /tmp (64 MiB), networkMode 'none' by default, cpu 1.0 / memory 512m, --rm cleanup, and a digest-pinned image (DOCKER_SANDBOX_IMAGE must contain @sha256:; DOCKER_SANDBOX_SKIP_DIGEST_CHECK=true bypasses with a warning and is NOT recommended for production). These invariants are asserted in docker-sandbox-executor.test.ts.",
