      "statement": "The engine creates a DockerSandboxExecutor inside startExecutionAttempt when task.metadata.sandbox.enabled===true, overriding image/cpu/memory/network/bind-mounts on DEFAULT_SANDBOX_CONFIG; deep-agent is explicitly forbidden from this Docker sandboxing path ('Deep Agent sandboxing is controlled by the sovereign runtime').",
